./data/living_catalog/taxonomy_rerun_preflight_2026-08-12/taxonomy/runs/classification_dense/shard_06/records/june_update_2026-06-10__rec_000148_32d2df447629/june_update_2026_06_10_rec_000148_32d2df447629_docling_json_20260812_203724/docling_graph/nodes.csv:9:"TaxonomyCodedRoute_1732df86cb450831","TaxonomyCodedRoute","entity","TaxonomyCodedRoute","Figure 6","SciCore-Omics","evaluation","patch-level and case-level H&E-based settings","whole-slide H&E images","whole-slide H&E images","histology image","['whole-slide H&E images', 'pathology reasoning', 'case-level interpretation of proliferative status']","['whole-slide histology images', 'reasoning', 'case-level clinical interpretation']","only the whole-slide H&E images were used as the model input","visual_raster_carrier","patch_context_or_case_level_visual_reasoning","only the whole-slide H&E images were used as the model input","side_or_generative_conditioning","generated_output","actual_model_input","only the whole-slide H&E images were used as the model input","1.6 SciCore-Omics enables H&E-based pathology reasoning","Figure 6","text_plus_figure","Figure 6 also includes PathVQA patch-level question answering; this route is coded on the whole-slide case-level branch.","{""document_id"": ""af7679d474fb57eca62f5cff6d4c2e2b"", ""match"": ""verbatim"", ""chunks"": [19], ""pages"": [11], ""refs"": [""#/pictures/5""], ""spans"": [{""chunk"": 19, ""start"": 13, ""end"": 21}]}","","","",""
